{"2377160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Not Only Nine", "steam_appid": 2377160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377160/extras/0aeb13211de1943e4cb7d652d4730566.avif?t=1779675796\" width=614 height=226 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Till All Complete</h2>You have fallen. Your soul is a cat, journeying to the <strong>center of The Afterlife</strong> in order to <strong>save your human.</strong> However, the <strong>Reapers</strong> will try to stop you from reaching The Tower. An <strong>ancient being</strong> (helps?) defeat Death itself in this <strong>narrative RPG</strong> with <strong>turn-based boss battles</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377160/extras/4139bfd773d618856d63352424a34abd.avif?t=1779675796\" width=614 height=226 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>NO quest markers - interact with residents of The Afterlife to progress.<br></li><li>Actually, there are no menus at all - game systems are directly integrated into the world.<br></li><li>Heartfelt story with deep characters that respond to actions you've taken.<br></li><li>I am sorry for what I do to these characters.<br></li><li>The best part of RPG's is exploring RPG towns so I put a lot of that.<br></li><li>Help lost souls become complete in cozy quests.<br></li><li>There is a button to sleep at any moment.<br></li><li>Fully original soundtrack composed with a story-first design.<br></li><li>NO random battles - only fight bosses (turn-based).<br></li><li>I just put battles 'cause they are cool - it's mostly a narrative game.<br></li><li>Decorate your cat with awesome RPG gear (which also levels you up).<br></li><li>Created by one developer and a small artist team.<br></li><li>This is a happy cute cat game I promise.</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377160/extras/0aeb13211de1943e4cb7d652d4730566.avif?t=1779675796\" width=614 height=226 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Till All Complete</h2>You have fallen. Your soul is a cat, journeying to the <strong>center of The Afterlife</strong> in order to <strong>save your human.</strong> However, the <strong>Reapers</strong> will try to stop you from reaching The Tower. An <strong>ancient being</strong> (helps?) defeat Death itself in this <strong>narrative RPG</strong> with <strong>turn-based boss battles</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377160/extras/4139bfd773d618856d63352424a34abd.avif?t=1779675796\" width=614 height=226 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>NO quest markers - interact with residents of The Afterlife to progress.<br></li><li>Actually, there are no menus at all - game systems are directly integrated into the world.<br></li><li>Heartfelt story with deep characters that respond to actions you've taken.<br></li><li>I am sorry for what I do to these characters.<br></li><li>The best part of RPG's is exploring RPG towns so I put a lot of that.<br></li><li>Help lost souls become complete in cozy quests.<br></li><li>There is a button to sleep at any moment.<br></li><li>Fully original soundtrack composed with a story-first design.<br></li><li>NO random battles - only fight bosses (turn-based).<br></li><li>I just put battles 'cause they are cool - it's mostly a narrative game.<br></li><li>Decorate your cat with awesome RPG gear (which also levels you up).<br></li><li>Created by one developer and a small artist team.<br></li><li>This is a happy cute cat game I promise.</li></ul>", "short_description": "A cat sou